# Cards

These names are not interchangeable.

- **Membership card** (also community membership card): the card minted when a person joins a community. It is `MembershipCard`. It stays landscape (`aspect-[86/54]`). The description is the back face, shown on hover. Show the full description. Do not preview it, line-clamp it, or cut it with an ellipsis.
- **Community card**: the card on the Communities tab. It is the article in `CommunityListing`. It is portrait. Its height comes from its own width, not from the leftover height of the page or the tab panel.

```tsx
// BAD — portrait membership card, description clipped
<MembershipCard className="aspect-[54/86]" description={previewCommunityDescription(text)} />

// GOOD — landscape membership card, full description on the back
<MembershipCard description={community.description} />
```
